 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_op_won_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_op_won_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_cael_rhyse",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "public_address",
   "source_text": "Citizens: the future is not a question. It is a result. You are watching it demonstrate itself, and the demonstration reads from your own districts' records.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 197,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_op_won_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_op_apparatus_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_op_apparatus_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "That is the Chancellor's apparatus talking — a public machine with a persuasive voice. What it demonstrates, we will verify independently or not believe.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 193,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_op_apparatus_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_op_method_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_op_method_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Two readbacks, two of us: I take one neutral interface, the verifier takes the other. Then the inputs, then the protocol, then we hold it stable and watch.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 195,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_op_method_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_op_exact_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_op_exact_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Well accepts what Lume Reach recorded and nothing else. If the demonstration needs a different protocol, then the demonstration is wrong.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 181,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_op_exact_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_readback_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_readback_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_readback_established",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Independent readback established at both interfaces. Two channels, two witnesses, no shared assumptions.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 144,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_readback_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_readback_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_readback_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_cael_rhyse",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_readback_established",
   "delivery_channel": "public_address",
   "source_text": "Note how the verification proceeds exactly as the demonstration predicted. Skepticism, too, is part of the result.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 154,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_readback_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_inputs_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_inputs_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_inputs_verified",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Both recorded inputs verify against the ledger. The apparatus points at true records. That is precisely what makes it worth watching carefully.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 183,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_inputs_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_inputs_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_inputs_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_inputs_verified",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Now the binding. Recorded protocol, separate Well, in the open.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 103,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_inputs_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_bound_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_bound_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_protocol_bound",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The protocol is bound. The activation receipt is live, and the window starts now: three hundred fixed ticks, counted by the simulation and nobody's speech.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 195,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_bound_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_bound_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_bound_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_protocol_bound",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Hold everything that matters. A stability window proves stability only if nothing is quietly propped up during it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 154,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_bound_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_held_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_held_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_window_held",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The window held, all three hundred ticks, with the receipt intact throughout. That fact is now ours, not the apparatus's.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 161,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_held_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_held_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_held_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_window_held",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Scouts to the district readbacks. We finish by observing what the districts themselves report, not what is reported about them.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 167,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_held_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_complete_observed_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_complete_observed_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_readbacks_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Both district readbacks observed, paired, and logged. The bound protocol held and the districts read it back true.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 154,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_complete_observed_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_readbacks_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "For the record: we verified a protocol, a window, and two readbacks. We did not verify a future. Those are different sizes of claim, whatever the apparatus says.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 201,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_complete_bounds_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_complete_rhyse_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_complete_rhyse_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_cael_rhyse",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_readbacks_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "public_address",
   "source_text": "The result stands, verified by its skeptics. The future that won thanks you for your diligence. It can afford to.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 153,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_complete_rhyse_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_fail_core_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_fail_core_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The command core is gone. The demonstration continues without its audit, which should worry everyone.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 141,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m12_vo_fail_core_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m12_line_fail_oruun_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m12_line_fail_oruun_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m12_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "I am cut off. Independent readback with one reader is a contradiction in terms.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 119,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
